msgid "Required"
msgstr "Exigidas"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/graphweb/falkon.xml:84
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"extra-cmake-modules\"/>, <xref linkend=\"kf6-frameworks\"/> "
"(for karchive), and <xref linkend=\"qtwebengine\"/>"
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"extra-cmake-modules\"/>, <xref linkend=\"kf6-frameworks\"/> "
"(para karchive) e <xref linkend=\"qtwebengine\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/graphweb/falkon.xml:91
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Strictly speaking, only karchive and ki18n are required to build falkon, but"
" several other packages in <xref linkend=\"kf6-frameworks\"/> can be used if"
" they are present. To build only karchive and ki18n, download those packages"
" from the directory specified in <xref linkend=\"kf6-frameworks\"/> and use "
"the build instructions on that page, changing the $KF6_PREFIX to /usr."
msgstr ""
"Estritamente falando, somente o karchive e ki18n são exigidos para construir"
" o falkon, mas vários outros pacotes no <xref linkend=\"kf6-frameworks\"/> "
"podem ser usados se estiverem presentes. Para construir somente o karchive e"
" ki18n, baixe esses pacotes a partir do diretório especificado em <xref "
"linkend=\"kf6-frameworks\"/> e use as instruções de construção naquela "
"página, mudando a $KF6_PREFIX para /usr."

